WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:01:35.400
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:42.200
From the moment you sat in this chair,

00:01:42.359 --> 00:01:43.920
you had no dignity left to speak of.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:47.120
Aren't you going to enjoy this last bit?

00:01:49.519 --> 00:01:50.319
How about it?

00:02:43.919 --> 00:02:46.360
Do you recognize anyone here?

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:12.639
I only know this one.

00:03:16.759 --> 00:03:17.759
We've crossed paths.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:19.960
She hit me with her bike once.

00:03:20.919 --> 00:03:21.879
Later,

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:25.240
at Nankang Middle School's centennial celebration,

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:26.400
she worked as a greeter.

00:03:31.039 --> 00:03:32.080
What kind of event was that?

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.560
It was arranged by Taiwanese spies.

00:03:35.879 --> 00:03:37.280
They wanted to rope me in.

00:03:52.439 --> 00:03:53.000
Excuse me.

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.960
Where's Room Three?

00:03:55.159 --> 00:03:56.439
Over there. Right at the end.

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:07.960
Come in.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:12.000
Have a seat.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:40.160
It's safe here.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:41.680
You can say anything.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:44.759
Fixed times, varying locations.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.240
That's how periodic reporting works.

00:04:52.639 --> 00:04:53.480
Relax.

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:55.160
Treat this like home.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:56.199
Like the military.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.759
Your boss from Taiwan, China,

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:01.279
what has he been up to lately?

00:05:01.279 --> 00:05:03.399
He's been busy moving.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:06.600
He mentioned moving a long time ago,

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.519
and even had me look at a few places.

00:05:08.519 --> 00:05:09.600
None of them worked out,

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:10.600
so it was delayed.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.639
Lately he said there are termites in the house,

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:13.519
so he wants to move again.

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:15.199
When he was house-hunting on his own,

00:05:15.879 --> 00:05:17.639
did he visit any unusual places?

00:05:18.199 --> 00:05:18.879
For example...

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:19.920
Near military bases?

00:05:20.439 --> 00:05:21.360
Near the port?

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:22.519
Near government offices?

00:05:22.879 --> 00:05:23.839
Or maybe...

00:05:23.839 --> 00:05:24.720
near radar stations?

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:28.439
I don't know where he went.

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:37.040
Of course you don't.

00:05:37.439 --> 00:05:39.040
But your boyfriend does.

00:05:39.519 --> 00:05:40.519
Because he's his legs,

00:05:40.519 --> 00:05:41.600
his feet,

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:42.480
his driver.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.360
Does he still go out taking photos?

00:05:46.519 --> 00:05:47.680
He stopped doing that long ago.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:50.160
Ever since the police talked sense into him,

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.160
he hasn't dared to do it again.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.240
National security...

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:56.920
sounds grand, abstract, and distant.

00:05:57.399 --> 00:06:00.399
In reality, it's small, close, and specific.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.199
Secrets are often leaked before anyone realizes,

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:06.959
and people inexplicably become suspects,

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:09.279
or even criminals.

00:06:10.639 --> 00:06:11.480
I've seen too many people

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.480
who feel wronged even on the execution ground,

00:06:13.959 --> 00:06:15.680
still believing they shouldn't be shot.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.079
That's why you must stay vigilant.

00:06:18.639 --> 00:06:19.959
Watch yourself to avoid making mistakes,

00:06:20.279 --> 00:06:21.720
and stay watchful of others.

00:06:21.879 --> 00:06:22.800
Otherwise, you'd never know

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:25.040
how a Taiwanese spy swam to the mainland.

00:06:26.759 --> 00:06:28.240
As for you specifically,

00:06:28.399 --> 00:06:29.120
Jin Lina,

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.160
while keeping tabs on Lin Kanshan,

00:06:33.279 --> 00:06:35.040
you must protect yourself first.

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:37.480
Never take risks at any time.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:38.800
Remember,

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:41.279
behind you stands a strong motherland,

00:06:41.759 --> 00:06:43.360
a powerful state security apparatus,

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:45.120
and the People's Liberation Army.

00:06:46.879 --> 00:06:47.600
And of course...

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:50.240
when you...

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:52.560
feel helpless,

00:06:52.879 --> 00:06:54.480
feel like you need help,

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:57.560
you've got me.

00:07:11.199 --> 00:07:12.279
So much food

00:07:12.279 --> 00:07:12.959
Okay

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:14.120
So many dishes to eat

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:15.160
Come on, let's have one

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.839
Come on, come on, come on

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:19.079
You've all worked hard lately

00:07:19.079 --> 00:07:19.839
Not at all

00:07:20.319 --> 00:07:21.319
Cheers

00:07:24.399 --> 00:07:27.439
Sweet-and-sour fish, stir-fried pig's blood

00:07:28.879 --> 00:07:30.160
Come on, come on

00:07:31.199 --> 00:07:32.600
Everyone, show some restraint

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:34.319
Sis Li still has to pack some up later

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:35.800
All right, that's enough

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.120
Just eat your food

00:07:37.279 --> 00:07:38.199
Even pig's blood can't shut you up

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:39.879
Get your sis some of that dish

00:07:40.759 --> 00:07:41.639
Is this pig's blood good?

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:42.519
Thanks

00:07:44.079 --> 00:07:44.839
Where are you going?

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.000
I need to return a call. You eat first

00:07:46.399 --> 00:07:47.480
Come on, let's have a drink

00:07:51.519 --> 00:07:52.439
Everybody eat a little less

00:07:52.439 --> 00:07:53.720
Leave more for Sis Li

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:58.279
What's so urgent?

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:00.560
It's just better than mine

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:01.279
Right?

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:02.560
I stay by the phone every day

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:03.759
Just waiting for your message

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.759
Which nephew of yours? What's his name?

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:06.680
Comrades

00:08:07.279 --> 00:08:08.000
Look who's here

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:11.199
The director's got a toothache from stress

00:08:11.199 --> 00:08:12.879
But he still came to see everyone

00:08:12.879 --> 00:08:13.399
Welcome

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:14.000
Welcome

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:14.600
Exactly

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:16.879
So where do you expect me to find him?

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.560
We've tracked this case for so long

00:08:19.839 --> 00:08:20.600
And it's finally solved

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.759
On behalf of the bureau, congrats to all

00:08:24.079 --> 00:08:24.720
Come on

00:08:25.639 --> 00:08:26.319
Director Wu

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:28.720
Where's Ma Qi?

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:31.360
Has his injury healed?

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.639
All right, let's raise a glass

00:08:34.919 --> 00:08:35.600
Cheers

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:36.879
You have to get the exact details.

00:08:36.879 --> 00:08:37.559
If you don't,

00:08:37.559 --> 00:08:38.679
I won't know where to find him.

00:08:38.679 --> 00:08:39.320
Thank you for your concern, sir

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:40.759
Call me back after you find out, all right?

00:08:41.519 --> 00:08:43.559
Thank you for your concern, sir

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:45.720
Ma Qi

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:47.159
Okay

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:48.840
Cheers

00:08:49.639 --> 00:08:50.639
Bring over two chairs

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:52.480
Okay, okay, scoot over that way

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:53.080
No need

00:08:53.399 --> 00:08:54.480
You all eat. I still have things to do

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:54.960
I'm heading out first

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:55.519
Okay

00:08:55.519 --> 00:08:56.120
You all eat

00:08:56.399 --> 00:08:57.200
Enjoy yourselves

00:08:57.360 --> 00:08:58.279
Take care, Director Wu

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.519
The case is solved

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:03.960
A reward is a reward

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:05.080
And punishment is punishment

00:09:06.919 --> 00:09:07.720
Ma Qi

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:09.399
You violated interrogation rules

00:09:09.399 --> 00:09:09.960
And used fatigue interrogation

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:10.759
What kind of conduct is that?

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:13.519
Have him write a report tomorrow morning

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:15.080
And bring it to my office

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:23.960
Old Wei

00:09:26.159 --> 00:09:27.360
I think I'm getting obsessed

00:09:28.519 --> 00:09:29.960
That person Jiang Zaizhen mentioned

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:32.320
One way or another, it's someone at this table

00:09:32.799 --> 00:09:34.080
Right now, everyone looks suspicious to me

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:36.919
A few days ago

00:09:37.519 --> 00:09:39.360
I took that fake file back with me

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.080
It had just been handed out at the morning briefing

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:42.440
And by night, it had already leaked

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:45.120
I hadn't even gotten home to make dinner

00:09:45.519 --> 00:09:47.120
The intel was already on the table in Taipei

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:47.919
Just that fast

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.639
They sure work fast

00:09:51.919 --> 00:09:54.159
Who at this table do you think it is?

00:09:55.279 --> 00:09:57.080
Without a near-certain lead

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.399
I don't dare make wild guesses

00:10:00.759 --> 00:10:02.200
A toothache may not be a disease

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:03.240
But when it hits, it can kill you

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:14.240
It's not convenient in the daytime

00:10:14.799 --> 00:10:17.000
Don't talk on the phone. See you soon

00:10:36.559 --> 00:10:37.960
The bait paste is a bit loose.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.399
You need to squeeze it tighter.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.639
Tightness doesn't matter.

00:10:41.799 --> 00:10:45.240
The real key is the fish.

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:47.600
Is it actually hungry tonight?

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.000
Waiting for your call,

00:10:50.679 --> 00:10:52.200
I didn't even eat dinner.

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:54.919
I thought, like last time,

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:56.559
you'd meet at a restaurant.

00:10:57.519 --> 00:10:58.679
You people...

00:10:59.519 --> 00:11:00.799
be more careful.

00:11:03.559 --> 00:11:04.919
The scar Cao Liaoping left on you...

00:11:04.919 --> 00:11:06.000
isn't it big enough yet?

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:09.480
Zhu Yingjia

00:11:10.039 --> 00:11:11.200
must be losing sleep, right?

00:11:12.159 --> 00:11:13.039
Fortunately, with you around,

00:11:14.039 --> 00:11:15.679
he can barely catch some shut-eye.

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:32.039
Look,

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:41.440
Cao Liaoping got into trouble.

00:11:41.919 --> 00:11:44.679
People will definitely investigate the institute.

00:11:44.879 --> 00:11:47.159
You share an office with him,

00:11:47.519 --> 00:11:48.960
and you've had verbal disputes.

00:11:50.399 --> 00:11:52.639
You'll inevitably have to cooperate with State Security.

00:11:53.039 --> 00:11:55.840
Between him and me, it was strictly academic.

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:59.000
There's no personal issue between the two of us.

00:11:59.000 --> 00:11:59.879
As for things I shouldn't say,

00:11:59.879 --> 00:12:01.200
I won't say a single word.

00:12:04.759 --> 00:12:05.879
Then can you guarantee

00:12:06.519 --> 00:12:08.480
that he knows nothing about my background?

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:10.600
Just like before,

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:12.600
when you didn't know his either?

00:12:13.039 --> 00:12:16.000
Back-to-back is our working principle.

00:12:40.519 --> 00:12:43.320
A corner was missing from the files Cao Liaoping gave us.

00:12:43.639 --> 00:12:45.200
The boss wants you to provide the missing part.

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:48.039
I've got a question.

00:12:49.440 --> 00:12:50.799
How much did you pay Old Cao?

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:06.440
Your workplace

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:08.639
doesn't publish your salaries either, right?

00:13:08.639 --> 00:13:10.440
It's all negotiated one-on-one.

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:12.600
I don't know the exact details.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.559
More than mine, right?

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.279
Definitely.

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:18.759
A pair of leather shoes he buys

00:13:18.759 --> 00:13:20.519
costs more than my entire monthly salary.

00:13:21.039 --> 00:13:24.039
Cao Liaoping is just too vain.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:26.240
I want more money.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.679
The intel I gave you is only half of it.

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:29.879
When you pay more,

00:13:30.279 --> 00:13:31.759
that's when you get the other half.

00:13:39.639 --> 00:13:41.759
Cao Liaoping, former Director of Office Seven,

00:13:42.159 --> 00:13:44.759
sold to intelligence agencies of Taiwan, China

00:13:45.159 --> 00:13:47.440
over 90 of our files and documents,

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.759
including one top-secret file,

00:13:50.039 --> 00:13:51.120
two secret files,

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:52.440
and 94 confidential files,

00:13:52.559 --> 00:13:54.559
resulting in grave security breaches.

00:13:54.759 --> 00:13:55.879
In this case,

00:13:56.039 --> 00:13:57.720
many of the files and documents

00:13:57.720 --> 00:13:59.879
were obtained through procedural loopholes,

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.159
taken without authorization,

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.240
and handed over to espionage agencies.

00:14:03.399 --> 00:14:06.279
This exposes weaknesses in the work

00:14:06.279 --> 00:14:08.080
of the relevant departments and divisions.

00:14:08.399 --> 00:14:09.320
Comrades,

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:11.559
espionage

00:14:11.919 --> 00:14:15.200
isn't just the thrills in blockbuster movies.

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:17.399
It often comes down to

00:14:17.759 --> 00:14:20.000
a single personal choice.

00:14:20.639 --> 00:14:21.720
So if anyone

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:25.080
notices any espionage activities around them,

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:27.240
be sure to report it immediately.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:39.399
Thanks, Brother Lu.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:42.320
It's not a pyramid scheme.

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:44.399
What is a pyramid scheme?

00:14:44.399 --> 00:14:46.080
A pyramid scheme makes you pay for products

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.159
and recruit people as your downline.

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.000
What we do is direct sales with kickbacks.

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:51.759
Come on, Brother Lu.

00:14:51.919 --> 00:14:52.799
What do you mean?

00:14:55.879 --> 00:14:56.679
Lend me a hundred.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:58.240
Even 50 will do.

00:14:58.440 --> 00:14:59.480
I'll round it up to earn some interest.

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:00.600
I'll definitely pay you back next week.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:01.720
Upstairs complained yesterday,

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:03.440
saying the smell up there was terrible.

00:15:03.639 --> 00:15:04.919
How are you people doing your job every day?

00:15:04.919 --> 00:15:05.960
Don't you check?

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:07.320
If you don't want to work, get the hell out!

00:15:08.399 --> 00:15:09.440
Xiao Tang, Xiao Tang.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:10.240
Let me tell you—

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:10.679
No, wait—

00:15:10.679 --> 00:15:11.200
Listen to me.

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:12.399
Xiao Lu.

00:15:12.559 --> 00:15:13.559
Xiao Lu!

00:15:15.559 --> 00:15:16.200
Sis Xia.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:17.200
Go on up.

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:17.639
Okay.

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:20.039
Here to visit the guys?

00:15:20.759 --> 00:15:22.159
Look at you, all decked out in bling.

00:15:22.279 --> 00:15:24.440
Heard you've been doing well for yourself.

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.200
Working for Boss Xiao Lin

00:15:29.399 --> 00:15:30.519
is way better than staying here, huh?

00:15:30.759 --> 00:15:33.320
Not really. Wherever I go, I just run errands.

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:34.639
Just let me know if you need anything.

00:15:35.759 --> 00:15:37.519
Actually, there is something you could help with.

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.039
Business has been good lately.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.039
I'm looking for some part-time girls

00:15:41.039 --> 00:15:43.200
to sing and drink with guests.

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.519
Free to come and go as they please.

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:46.159
What's the pay?

00:15:46.759 --> 00:15:50.039
Depends on the horse, fast or slow.

00:15:50.399 --> 00:15:52.320
I'll have to see them in person first.

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:55.480
But for every girl who joins,

00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:57.080
you'll get a cut.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:01.240
Could I get an advance first?

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:06.480
Welcome to Pacific Nightclub!

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:13.879
Head right on inside!

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:14.440
Come on.

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:16.559
Come in, everyone come inside.

00:16:17.279 --> 00:16:17.600
Everyone, come in.

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:18.200
Please come in.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:18.840
Come have a seat.

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:19.240
Please come in, come in.

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.159
Come sit down, everyone!

00:16:20.159 --> 00:16:21.399
Sit anywhere. Take a seat.

00:16:21.559 --> 00:16:22.440
Make yourselves at home, everyone.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:23.559
Just relax, make yourselves comfortable.

00:16:23.679 --> 00:16:24.600
Don't be so shy.

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:25.440
Take it easy.

00:16:25.559 --> 00:16:25.840
Help yourselves to the drinks.

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:27.200
Whoever wants to sing, come pick a song!

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:28.200
Drink up, drink whatever you like!

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:28.600
Come on over!

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:29.519
Press this button here,

00:16:29.519 --> 00:16:30.559
and then press this one.

00:16:30.559 --> 00:16:31.960
Then it's set for a duet.

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:32.679
Got it?

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:33.519
Then we'll...

00:16:33.519 --> 00:16:34.159
Waiter!

00:16:34.159 --> 00:16:34.720
Come on, let's go.

00:16:35.399 --> 00:16:37.600
Swap all fruit platters for large ones! All of them!

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:38.480
You go first.

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:43.720
Pick one you know how to sing.

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:48.200
Happy birthday to you

00:16:48.519 --> 00:16:51.039
Happy birthday to you

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:53.480
Happy birthday to you

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:54.279
Are you out of your mind?

00:16:54.279 --> 00:16:55.759
How much is this going to cost?

00:16:55.759 --> 00:16:57.360
You told me it was free, that's why I came!

00:16:57.679 --> 00:16:58.960
My birthday was last month!

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:00.200
Did I ask you to make up for it?

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:01.559
Business has been slow lately.

00:17:01.559 --> 00:17:02.919
The boss had us come fill the place up.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:03.720
Sis Xia arranged it.

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:04.559
It won't cost a single cent.

00:17:04.559 --> 00:17:05.319
Really?

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:18.319
They're all part-timers.

00:17:18.319 --> 00:17:19.519
They have their day jobs,

00:17:19.519 --> 00:17:20.839
and just drop by here at night.

00:17:20.839 --> 00:17:21.720
The tips are really good.

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:22.559
Why turn down the money?

00:17:23.039 --> 00:17:24.720
Isn't that just selling yourself?

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:26.400
Anything's better than doing this.

00:17:27.519 --> 00:17:28.759
Make a wish, make a wish!

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:30.160
Everyone together, come on!

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:30.960
All right.

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:37.160
Happy birthday!

00:17:37.559 --> 00:17:38.599
What did you wish for?

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:39.279
Brother Lu.

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:40.799
Sis Xia sent over a bottle of liquor.

00:17:40.799 --> 00:17:41.839
They won't drink it? Never mind then.

00:17:42.039 --> 00:17:42.839
Wait.

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:45.039
It's on the house anyway.

00:17:45.039 --> 00:17:46.240
Might as well drink it.

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:47.599
Come on, what's the harm in tasting it?

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:48.559
Okay.

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:50.960
Glasses, glasses, glasses!

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:51.559
Go grab some glasses.

00:17:51.559 --> 00:17:52.119
What kind of liquor is this?

00:17:52.119 --> 00:17:52.920
Glasses, glasses.

00:17:53.039 --> 00:17:53.839
Here, here.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:55.920
We can ask the waiter

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.480
to bring a knife over to cut the cake.

00:18:00.519 --> 00:18:01.759
Teacher Zhang.

00:18:01.759 --> 00:18:02.559
Your mom's on the phone.

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:06.720
I heard that kid Xiao Lu

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:08.160
is borrowing money all over the place.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.319
Word has spread everywhere.

00:18:09.319 --> 00:18:10.480
Everyone out there knows.

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:13.119
Who in the county told you that this time?

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:16.240
People! People are all talking about it!

00:18:16.359 --> 00:18:16.720
You know?

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:18.519
People, people, always "people"!

00:18:18.519 --> 00:18:19.319
Who are these people?

00:18:19.319 --> 00:18:20.559
What are their names?

00:18:20.559 --> 00:18:21.440
Who exactly?

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:22.440
The neighbors around here,

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:23.359
and your colleagues,

00:18:23.359 --> 00:18:24.480
they're all saying it!

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:25.039
Don't you know?

00:18:25.039 --> 00:18:26.200
Did he actually borrow money?

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:27.319
How much did he borrow?

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:28.880
A whole lot, of course!

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:30.240
People are throwing around all kinds of numbers!

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:30.799
Don't you know?

00:18:30.799 --> 00:18:32.359
Then how much did he borrow exactly?

00:18:32.559 --> 00:18:34.160
He definitely borrowed money.

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:35.359
Borrowing money...

00:18:35.359 --> 00:18:36.960
That kid must've gone gambling again.

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:37.799
How could he?

00:18:38.079 --> 00:18:40.160
I'm telling you, he's working as a driver now.

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:41.480
He hasn't been gambling!

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:43.160
Why do you believe whatever others say,

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:44.880
yet never listen to a word I tell you?

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:45.880
Listen to what you say?

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:47.680
You never listen all day long!

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:49.279
You just love making me worry!

00:18:49.799 --> 00:18:50.799
I don't want to talk to you anymore.

00:18:50.799 --> 00:18:52.279
I really don't want to talk to either of you.

00:18:56.839 --> 00:18:58.400
Why does her family have so much drama?

00:19:02.559 --> 00:19:04.599
Get in. He's giving us a ride.

00:19:04.599 --> 00:19:05.119
It's fine, it's fine.

00:19:05.119 --> 00:19:05.920
Get in, get in, get in!

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:06.680
I'll drive you, I'll drive you.

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:07.359
I'll give you guys a ride.

00:19:07.519 --> 00:19:08.400
Come on, let's go.

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:09.400
It's no trouble at all.

00:19:09.599 --> 00:19:11.480
Squeeze in, squeeze in. All right.

00:19:13.119 --> 00:19:14.680
Brother Cai, there you are!

00:19:15.079 --> 00:19:16.119
Why didn't you call me?

00:19:56.359 --> 00:19:58.519
Pay up, or I'll cripple your right foot.

00:20:10.839 --> 00:20:12.319
Are you really going to work there?

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:14.279
Exactly. It's so dangerous!

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:15.640
It's really not worth it.

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:17.440
What if something happens?

00:20:19.119 --> 00:20:20.480
You have to be extra careful.

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:21.440
Is it worth it?

00:20:22.319 --> 00:20:23.359
You could lose your life!

00:20:23.519 --> 00:20:24.920
I can't worry about that now.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.839
Good evening, Boss.

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:32.799
No, don't!

00:20:33.079 --> 00:20:33.880
Please don't!

00:20:34.119 --> 00:20:34.799
No!

00:21:10.519 --> 00:21:11.039
Surname's Lin.

00:21:11.519 --> 00:21:12.359
Page the owner,

00:21:12.799 --> 00:21:15.079
and ask where her driver went.

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:16.839
We agreed to move at 8:30,

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:18.400
but he's still nowhere to be seen.

00:21:18.559 --> 00:21:19.359
What's going on?

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:27.759
Boss...

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:31.200
Where's Xiao Lu?

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:35.119
Speak up!

00:21:35.759 --> 00:21:36.480
I'm sorry.

00:21:42.039 --> 00:21:42.880
What's that supposed to mean?

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:48.079
Where's Xiao Lu? Answer me!

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:49.240
Xiao Lu...

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:50.799
Xiao Lu...

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:52.240
He...

00:21:53.039 --> 00:21:55.440
He was lured into gambling.

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:58.680
He got conned.

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:02.200
He lost all the rent money.

00:22:02.799 --> 00:22:05.000
What the hell? What the hell?

00:22:07.279 --> 00:22:09.880
I went to check the place.

00:22:09.880 --> 00:22:11.599
It's already been rented to someone else.

00:22:18.880 --> 00:22:19.880
Piece of shit!

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:22.359
Absolute trash!

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:34.799
Where is he?

00:22:35.240 --> 00:22:35.960
He...

00:22:36.480 --> 00:22:38.160
Maybe he lost his cell signal.

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:40.039
I can't reach him right now.

00:22:42.359 --> 00:22:43.319
Boss.

00:22:43.319 --> 00:22:44.559
Boss, where are you going?

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:46.240
Boss!

00:22:48.079 --> 00:22:49.640
He's already gone to borrow money from relatives.

00:22:49.839 --> 00:22:51.359
He definitely won't run away.

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:53.480
I'll stay right here as collateral.

00:22:54.119 --> 00:22:55.400
Boss, I know right now

00:22:55.400 --> 00:22:56.720
you must be furious.

00:22:57.200 --> 00:22:59.440
Because I'm the one who recommended him as your driver.

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:00.680
But I swear,

00:23:00.680 --> 00:23:01.640
neither of us will run.

00:23:01.640 --> 00:23:03.640
The money will be paid back as soon as possible.

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:06.039
How about putting next month's salary toward it too?

00:23:06.039 --> 00:23:06.599
You...

00:23:06.839 --> 00:23:08.000
Who pays your salary anyway?

00:23:10.599 --> 00:23:12.279
A degenerate gambler is hopeless!

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:13.839
Compound interest from loan sharks will kill you!

00:23:13.839 --> 00:23:14.799
Don't you get it?

00:23:15.759 --> 00:23:16.839
Once you get involved, there's no coming back.

00:23:16.839 --> 00:23:17.720
He's bound to run!

00:23:17.880 --> 00:23:19.119
And you're still defending him!

00:23:19.200 --> 00:23:20.079
Did your brain

00:23:20.079 --> 00:23:21.160
get clogged up with crab porridge?

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:24.039
Boss, watch out!

00:23:24.200 --> 00:23:24.880
There's a ditch ahead!

00:23:24.880 --> 00:23:25.440
A ditch?

00:23:26.079 --> 00:23:27.319
You two are the ones who dug this pit for me!

00:23:27.640 --> 00:23:28.799
First it was my watch,

00:23:28.960 --> 00:23:29.880
and now it's my car!

00:23:30.079 --> 00:23:31.119
Now he's nowhere to be found!

00:23:31.519 --> 00:23:32.079
Let me tell you,

00:23:32.079 --> 00:23:33.519
if he loses my car,

00:23:33.519 --> 00:23:35.440
even selling yourself won't cover it!

00:23:36.319 --> 00:23:37.359
Stay here as collateral?

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:38.759
Do you think you're worth that much?

00:23:39.599 --> 00:23:40.799
Keep you as collateral?

00:23:41.079 --> 00:23:43.119
I've already started working at Pacific Nightclub.

00:23:46.920 --> 00:23:47.720
Have you lost your mind?

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:50.119
Working there pays well with lots of tips,

00:23:50.119 --> 00:23:51.279
so the debt can be paid off faster.

00:23:51.319 --> 00:23:52.640
How much is an hour at a nightclub?

00:23:52.839 --> 00:23:54.359
How much to spend the night with someone?

00:23:54.359 --> 00:23:55.880
How many years will it take you to pay it back?

00:23:55.880 --> 00:23:56.599
Are you—

00:23:58.960 --> 00:24:01.359
Don't worry. I said I won't run, and I won't.

00:24:01.359 --> 00:24:02.920
If I say I can pay it back, I definitely will.

00:24:03.640 --> 00:24:04.640
We live under the rule of law.

00:24:04.640 --> 00:24:06.480
Don't think so dirty.

00:24:07.279 --> 00:24:09.359
Paying back debts is nothing to be ashamed of.

00:24:10.359 --> 00:24:12.079
Boss, where are you going?

00:24:13.079 --> 00:24:14.519
Are you going to the police?

00:24:15.400 --> 00:24:16.680
If calling the police worked,

00:24:17.039 --> 00:24:19.200
the loan sharks looking for debtors

00:24:19.200 --> 00:24:20.839
would've packed the police station long ago!

00:24:22.160 --> 00:24:23.200
Then where are you going?

00:24:23.200 --> 00:24:24.160
Where else can I go?

00:24:24.559 --> 00:24:24.680
Go to work and earn money!

00:24:24.680 --> 00:24:25.680
Go to work and earn money!

00:24:25.680 --> 00:24:26.799
To support the two of you!

00:24:26.839 --> 00:24:27.799
You pair of con artists!

00:24:28.720 --> 00:24:29.960
Get lost! Stop following me!

00:24:31.480 --> 00:24:32.960
Call him! Keep calling!

00:24:33.240 --> 00:24:35.039
Tell him not to screw up Wu Jinhe's business!

00:24:35.240 --> 00:24:36.160
Drive the car properly,

00:24:36.160 --> 00:24:37.799
and sort out the rest once he gets his ass back!

00:24:54.480 --> 00:24:56.079
Brother, where are you?

00:24:56.079 --> 00:24:58.240
Brother, I'm on my way to work.

00:24:58.880 --> 00:25:00.240
Off to work this early?

00:25:00.440 --> 00:25:02.400
Guess you didn't drink enough last night.

00:25:02.559 --> 00:25:04.039
I thought you'd still be sleeping it off.

00:25:04.039 --> 00:25:05.720
Is something up, brother?

00:25:07.000 --> 00:25:08.440
What could be up with me?

00:25:09.400 --> 00:25:11.559
It's Qian Xinfu, that tough nut to crack.

00:25:12.079 --> 00:25:13.279
He still won't budge.

00:25:13.279 --> 00:25:14.519
I can't sleep easy.

00:25:14.680 --> 00:25:15.519
I was wondering

00:25:16.200 --> 00:25:18.000
if my driver hasn't served you well enough.

00:25:18.279 --> 00:25:20.960
Brother, you can't hold that against him.

00:25:21.599 --> 00:25:22.799
How could I?

00:25:22.960 --> 00:25:25.119
The driver you assigned me is very diligent.

00:25:25.480 --> 00:25:27.039
He just took yesterday off,

00:25:27.039 --> 00:25:27.920
saying he sprained his ankle.

00:25:27.920 --> 00:25:29.240
Took yesterday off, huh?

00:25:29.240 --> 00:25:30.119
A sprained ankle?

00:25:31.440 --> 00:25:32.400
So is he back now?

00:25:32.640 --> 00:25:33.720
He's here, he's here.

00:25:33.839 --> 00:25:34.960
Right by your side now?

00:25:34.960 --> 00:25:36.039
He came back early this morning.

00:25:36.039 --> 00:25:36.960
That's good, then.

00:25:37.440 --> 00:25:39.240
Still, I have to thank you, brother.

00:25:39.480 --> 00:25:41.000
As long as you're satisfied.

00:25:41.000 --> 00:25:42.960
Not many can please Director Wu.

00:25:42.960 --> 00:25:44.480
Drinks another day—my treat.

00:25:44.480 --> 00:25:46.119
All right, drinks another day!

00:26:12.079 --> 00:26:13.359
You've been to the antique street.

00:26:13.359 --> 00:26:14.519
I have a friend

00:26:14.519 --> 00:26:16.400
who opened a shop like that in Taiwan, China.

00:26:16.400 --> 00:26:18.240
These classified red-header files from the mainland

00:26:18.240 --> 00:26:19.880
are rare commodities over there, too.

00:26:20.400 --> 00:26:21.440
They can fetch good money.

00:27:17.200 --> 00:27:18.240
Happy Mid-Autumn Festival, Brother Shan.

00:27:18.519 --> 00:27:19.599
We brought you some mooncakes.

00:27:20.720 --> 00:27:21.359
You're too kind!

00:27:21.359 --> 00:27:21.880
Come, come, come.

00:27:21.880 --> 00:27:22.680
Come on in and take a seat.

00:27:23.119 --> 00:27:23.759
Should we take off our shoes?

00:27:23.759 --> 00:27:24.240
No need, no need.

00:27:24.240 --> 00:27:24.920
Don't worry about it.

00:27:25.200 --> 00:27:25.640
Come on in.

00:27:25.880 --> 00:27:27.160
We just finished dinner ourselves.

00:27:27.160 --> 00:27:28.079
Figured you were all by yourself,

00:27:28.079 --> 00:27:28.960
so we came by to check on you.

00:27:29.480 --> 00:27:30.359
Thank you, sister-in-law,

00:27:30.640 --> 00:27:32.039
and brother, for caring about me.

00:27:32.480 --> 00:27:33.440
Do you have a plate here?

00:27:33.440 --> 00:27:33.880
Let's get a plate

00:27:33.880 --> 00:27:34.680
to put the mooncakes on.

00:27:34.680 --> 00:27:35.119
Yes, of course.

00:27:35.119 --> 00:27:35.799
I'll grab one for you.

00:27:35.920 --> 00:27:36.839
Make yourselves at home.

00:27:37.799 --> 00:27:40.079
Try some of my Oriental Beauty tea.

00:27:40.640 --> 00:27:42.079
It's top-grade oolong tea.

00:27:44.319 --> 00:27:44.920
Have a taste.

00:27:45.720 --> 00:27:46.279
Here, here, here.

00:27:46.279 --> 00:27:46.880
Please, go ahead.

00:27:53.720 --> 00:27:54.480
This looks great.

00:27:54.480 --> 00:27:55.480
Lotus seed paste with egg yolk.

00:27:56.079 --> 00:27:57.680
What fillings do they usually have in Taiwan, China?

00:27:57.680 --> 00:27:58.759
This is actually my favorite.

00:27:59.160 --> 00:28:00.599
What about pineapple cakes? Do you eat those?

00:28:00.599 --> 00:28:01.319
Whenever I want to eat them,

00:28:01.319 --> 00:28:02.359
they're always readily available.

00:28:03.599 --> 00:28:05.480
Want to have some drinks after the tea?

00:28:05.960 --> 00:28:07.000
No, no drinks.

00:28:07.119 --> 00:28:07.920
I drank way too much yesterday.

00:28:07.920 --> 00:28:08.680
Taking it easy today.

00:28:09.920 --> 00:28:10.519
All right, then.

00:28:10.519 --> 00:28:11.880
Then I'll toast with mooncake instead of liquor.

00:28:12.519 --> 00:28:14.319
Here's to good neighbors coming together,

00:28:15.000 --> 00:28:17.240
and a Happy Mid-Autumn Festival!

00:29:25.359 --> 00:29:27.400
The United States does not support independence for Taiwan, China,

00:29:27.400 --> 00:29:29.200
does not support "two Chinas,"

00:29:29.200 --> 00:29:31.319
and does not support Taiwan, China joining

00:29:31.319 --> 00:29:32.680
any international organization

00:29:32.680 --> 00:29:34.599
that requires statehood.

00:29:34.599 --> 00:29:36.200
President Clinton, this morning

00:29:36.359 --> 00:29:38.559
at a White House press conference,

00:29:38.960 --> 00:29:40.720
publicly reaffirmed this commitment.

00:29:42.000 --> 00:29:43.000
This is for

00:29:44.000 --> 00:29:45.039
Workshop One.

00:29:46.400 --> 00:29:47.799
This is for Workshop Two.

00:29:47.799 --> 00:29:49.440
And Three, Four, Five, Six.

00:29:49.440 --> 00:29:50.960
Here's the list, all accounted for.

00:29:51.079 --> 00:29:52.839
Put them in envelopes to hand out to everyone.

00:29:54.160 --> 00:29:56.839
We made 80,000 mascots in just one week.

00:29:56.920 --> 00:29:58.240
If the World Cup had our speed,

00:29:58.240 --> 00:29:59.759
Brazil wouldn't even need to play the final.

00:29:59.759 --> 00:30:01.319
They'd have gone home with their bonus already.

00:30:02.440 --> 00:30:04.839
If they score a goal,

00:30:04.920 --> 00:30:06.400
how much bonus money do you think they get?

00:30:07.279 --> 00:30:09.759
I think you're giving them too much.

00:30:09.880 --> 00:30:11.240
If you give this much now,

00:30:11.240 --> 00:30:12.359
what if money gets tight later?

00:30:12.400 --> 00:30:13.359
How will you manage them?

00:30:13.559 --> 00:30:14.079
Don't worry about it.

00:30:14.079 --> 00:30:15.039
I have to pay them.

00:30:15.039 --> 00:30:16.759
High rewards will always spur people on.

00:30:16.759 --> 00:30:18.960
We're in a race against time!

00:30:19.160 --> 00:30:20.400
Once the World Cup is over,

00:30:20.400 --> 00:30:22.480
all of that stuff will just be worthless junk.

00:30:22.759 --> 00:30:24.759
Every second of production means more money made!

00:30:24.759 --> 00:30:25.599
Don't you get it?

00:30:26.440 --> 00:30:27.559
Let's stir-fry some greens.

00:30:28.039 --> 00:30:28.960
What else did you buy?

00:30:28.960 --> 00:30:29.920
I also bought carrots.

00:30:29.920 --> 00:30:31.160
We can make pork stir-fried with carrots.

00:30:31.279 --> 00:30:32.799
And scrambled eggs with tomatoes.

00:30:39.039 --> 00:30:41.200
And... and I bought ribs.

00:30:48.799 --> 00:30:50.319
Then should we stew the ribs?

00:30:50.759 --> 00:30:51.599
Go ahead and stew them.

00:30:51.599 --> 00:30:52.039
Okay.

00:30:56.079 --> 00:30:56.680
Dad?

00:30:57.559 --> 00:30:58.480
Can you hear me?

00:31:00.119 --> 00:31:01.119
It's me.

00:31:02.279 --> 00:31:04.200
Why did you take so long to pick up?

00:31:07.640 --> 00:31:08.559
Where's the nurse?

00:31:09.400 --> 00:31:10.799
Why didn't she help you to the bathroom?

00:31:13.319 --> 00:31:15.240
Then wait until she gets back with your meal!

00:31:15.319 --> 00:31:16.319
It won't take that long.

00:31:19.079 --> 00:31:20.039
I'm at home now.

00:31:20.880 --> 00:31:22.440
I just signed up for international long-distance.

00:31:23.480 --> 00:31:24.599
It's available for residential use here now.

00:31:25.319 --> 00:31:26.559
It doesn't cost much.

00:31:26.920 --> 00:31:28.720
Better than going out to make VoIP calls.

00:31:30.599 --> 00:31:32.119
The clothes and shoes I had my classmate take to you,

00:31:32.119 --> 00:31:32.880
did you get them?

00:31:35.799 --> 00:31:37.319
I picked out the clothes especially for you.

00:31:37.319 --> 00:31:38.000
The collar is very loose,

00:31:38.000 --> 00:31:39.160
so it won't choke you.

00:31:41.200 --> 00:31:42.000
If you think they're too expensive,

00:31:42.000 --> 00:31:43.079
you can return them.

00:31:43.079 --> 00:31:44.799
If you don't like wearing them, just throw them out.

00:31:44.799 --> 00:31:46.279
Don't nag me about this stuff every time.

00:31:46.279 --> 00:31:46.920
Okay?

00:31:47.319 --> 00:31:49.480
How much could a shirt and a pair of shoes cost?

00:31:50.039 --> 00:31:51.000
I'm really busy.

00:31:51.000 --> 00:31:52.359
Don't bring this up every single time.

00:31:52.359 --> 00:31:53.799
I have to beg you to wear them every time!

00:31:58.640 --> 00:31:59.640
All right, all right.

00:32:00.480 --> 00:32:01.920
I picked out the shoes too.

00:32:01.920 --> 00:32:02.839
They're non-slip.

00:32:03.559 --> 00:32:04.000
Honestly,

00:32:04.000 --> 00:32:05.319
if your legs were in good shape,

00:32:05.319 --> 00:32:06.200
and you could run and jump around,

00:32:06.200 --> 00:32:07.240
I wouldn't have to call the hospital

00:32:07.240 --> 00:32:09.039
looking for you every week, right?

00:32:10.400 --> 00:32:11.200
Just put them on.

00:32:11.200 --> 00:32:12.079
Please?

00:32:12.759 --> 00:32:14.240
I'm begging you to just listen to me.

00:32:16.160 --> 00:32:17.880
Okay, talk to you next time.

00:32:28.160 --> 00:32:29.880
Everyone puts on an act outside.

00:32:30.119 --> 00:32:32.640
They only lose their temper with their parents at home.

00:32:33.440 --> 00:32:35.440
Lin Kanshan sure has quite a temper with his dad.

00:32:48.319 --> 00:32:48.960
By the way,

00:32:49.480 --> 00:32:51.240
that woman we ran into at the crossroad today,

00:32:51.559 --> 00:32:53.440
she's the general manager of Pacific Nightclub.

00:32:53.680 --> 00:32:55.640
Brother Qi and I go there often, so I know her.

00:32:55.880 --> 00:32:57.279
She probably worried you'd get the wrong idea,

00:32:57.279 --> 00:32:58.839
so she didn't dare say hello to me.

00:32:59.319 --> 00:33:00.119
No need to explain.

00:33:00.319 --> 00:33:01.680
I'm not mad anyway.

00:33:04.000 --> 00:33:04.920
If you noticed something,

00:33:04.920 --> 00:33:06.039
you should be questioning me.

00:33:06.599 --> 00:33:07.960
Given the state of our relationship,

00:33:08.119 --> 00:33:09.640
there's no way you aren't mad.

00:33:11.279 --> 00:33:12.880
Maybe my way of being mad

00:33:12.880 --> 00:33:14.440
is just bottling it up inside.

00:33:14.720 --> 00:33:16.039
Everyone has a different personality.

00:33:16.839 --> 00:33:19.359
I'd always heard wiretapping is the most grueling job,

00:33:19.839 --> 00:33:22.079
but I never thought it'd be this dull.

00:33:23.880 --> 00:33:25.119
The target has so much freedom.

00:33:25.559 --> 00:33:27.079
Coming and going whenever he pleases,

00:33:27.240 --> 00:33:29.480
while we have to revolve around his routine.

00:33:29.480 --> 00:33:30.960
Never mind dating or getting married.

00:33:31.440 --> 00:33:32.960
If my partner didn't talk,

00:33:33.680 --> 00:33:34.599
wouldn't I suffocate of boredom?

00:33:35.359 --> 00:33:36.720
I think what this job needs

00:33:36.720 --> 00:33:37.720
isn't a human being,

00:33:37.960 --> 00:33:39.359
but a machine.

00:33:40.200 --> 00:33:42.000
Or rather, turning humans into machines.

00:33:43.240 --> 00:33:44.680
Anyway, I've already made up my mind.

00:33:45.519 --> 00:33:47.039
If I really can't take it, I'll quit.

00:33:47.880 --> 00:33:49.720
I never thought you'd say that.

00:33:56.160 --> 00:33:57.960
It's not like giving a speech at work.

00:33:58.359 --> 00:34:00.400
If you don't even dare say what you really feel,

00:34:00.400 --> 00:34:01.480
then how are you going to endure

00:34:01.480 --> 00:34:03.400
this day-in, day-out grind?

00:34:04.599 --> 00:34:05.720
It's not just wiretapping;

00:34:05.720 --> 00:34:06.759
we have to monitor signals, too.

00:34:07.240 --> 00:34:09.159
It's giving me OCD at this point,

00:34:09.159 --> 00:34:10.360
terrified of missing anything.

00:34:10.760 --> 00:34:12.119
I don't dare let my guard down for a second.

00:34:12.440 --> 00:34:13.679
I even dream about Lin Kanshan.

00:34:15.039 --> 00:34:16.199
Same here.

00:34:17.000 --> 00:34:18.360
Even when I leave the house,

00:34:18.639 --> 00:34:19.599
I'm always worried I forgot to lock the door.

00:34:19.960 --> 00:34:21.679
Every time I return, it's locked.

00:34:21.800 --> 00:34:24.320
I'm just scared that the one time I don't check,

00:34:24.320 --> 00:34:25.440
it'll happen to be the time it was left unlocked,

00:34:25.440 --> 00:34:26.519
and a burglar breaks in.

00:34:26.599 --> 00:34:27.679
Surveillance is the same way.

00:34:27.960 --> 00:34:28.719
Old Wei said

00:34:28.719 --> 00:34:31.119
our nerves always have to stay taut.

00:34:31.199 --> 00:34:32.559
But for how long?

00:34:32.559 --> 00:34:33.360
Will the string snap?

00:34:33.880 --> 00:34:35.760
I heard when they used to stake out targets,

00:34:35.760 --> 00:34:36.599
it was just like us—

00:34:36.599 --> 00:34:37.559
working in pairs.

00:34:37.760 --> 00:34:39.159
Every day, they just stared across at the guy,

00:34:39.159 --> 00:34:40.199
watching when he left.

00:34:40.440 --> 00:34:41.800
Who knows how many days they kept watch.

00:34:42.320 --> 00:34:44.280
Once, they blinked, and the guy was gone.

00:34:44.280 --> 00:34:45.440
But that's how it is sometimes.

00:34:45.440 --> 00:34:46.360
When the brain keeps observing

00:34:46.360 --> 00:34:47.920
a single thing for a prolonged time,

00:34:47.920 --> 00:34:48.760
it goes numb.

00:34:48.880 --> 00:34:49.679
Let me tell you,

00:34:49.679 --> 00:34:51.039
some people are true masters.

00:34:51.039 --> 00:34:51.719
Brother Qi can do it.

00:34:51.719 --> 00:34:53.800
He reads novels in the car while keeping watch.

00:34:53.960 --> 00:34:55.119
The moment the guy walks out,

00:34:55.119 --> 00:34:56.480
he spots him with just a glance.

00:34:57.119 --> 00:34:58.760
I never believe in those legends.

00:34:58.920 --> 00:35:00.280
Isn't it just building up experience?

00:35:00.719 --> 00:35:01.960
I just really admire

00:35:01.960 --> 00:35:03.119
how they built it up,

00:35:03.119 --> 00:35:04.239
how they endured it all.

00:35:04.800 --> 00:35:06.000
Instructor Wu said

00:35:06.360 --> 00:35:08.440
wiretapping is like digging through a dark tunnel.

00:35:08.760 --> 00:35:10.119
There's no light at all.

00:35:11.159 --> 00:35:12.559
You just grope your way forward.

00:35:12.760 --> 00:35:15.119
No one knows which way the opening is,

00:35:15.679 --> 00:35:16.639
or whether digging ahead

00:35:16.639 --> 00:35:18.159
will lead to a ditch or a gold mine.

00:35:18.880 --> 00:35:19.800
The most important thing

00:35:20.199 --> 00:35:22.119
is learning how to kill the boredom each day.

00:35:23.559 --> 00:35:24.920
So did Wu Jiali

00:35:24.920 --> 00:35:26.440
give you any tips?

00:35:26.559 --> 00:35:27.519
Telling stories.

00:35:27.679 --> 00:35:29.159
Just like in a cave tens of thousands of years ago,

00:35:29.159 --> 00:35:30.519
when the cavemen couldn't fall asleep.

00:35:51.719 --> 00:35:52.559
Why are you here?

00:35:53.480 --> 00:35:54.960
The hospital needs a decision made,

00:35:55.119 --> 00:35:56.159
and I couldn't reach you.

00:35:57.760 --> 00:35:59.079
I've been busy and didn't check my pager.

00:35:59.440 --> 00:36:00.719
If I don't reply, just call my cell.

00:36:02.039 --> 00:36:04.480
I worried you were busy or in a meeting.

00:36:05.159 --> 00:36:06.559
At a time like this, don't worry about that.

00:36:06.800 --> 00:36:07.360
What did the hospital say?

00:36:10.159 --> 00:36:11.039
Here, take this.

00:36:12.559 --> 00:36:14.199
The chief doctor you contacted said

00:36:14.519 --> 00:36:15.960
she might still need surgery.

00:36:19.679 --> 00:36:21.280
These doctors' handwriting is like chicken scratch.

00:36:21.760 --> 00:36:22.719
Come on, let's talk inside.

00:36:23.880 --> 00:36:24.559
Forget it.

00:36:25.199 --> 00:36:26.679
No one is taking care of Mom.

00:36:26.800 --> 00:36:28.039
I have to hurry back.

00:36:33.559 --> 00:36:34.719
What are the chances of success?

00:36:35.639 --> 00:36:36.840
They didn't say.

00:36:37.719 --> 00:36:39.880
Just that without surgery...

00:36:40.679 --> 00:36:41.360
I'm afraid...

00:36:45.679 --> 00:36:46.800
Mom doesn't want to do it.

00:36:48.559 --> 00:36:49.840
I know she's scared.

00:36:50.639 --> 00:36:51.559
Scared it won't go well.

00:36:52.159 --> 00:36:53.840
Your uncle and aunt have no idea either.

00:36:54.440 --> 00:36:55.760
They told me to ask you.

00:37:01.360 --> 00:37:02.400
Does her head still hurt?

00:37:02.840 --> 00:37:04.400
It's better with medicine,

00:37:06.320 --> 00:37:07.360
but hurts without it.

00:37:08.079 --> 00:37:08.920
She can't take it anymore.

00:37:19.800 --> 00:37:21.239
Go back and get some rest.

00:37:24.639 --> 00:37:25.440
Okay.

00:37:46.119 --> 00:37:48.519
Brother Baoshan told me everything I know,

00:37:48.800 --> 00:37:50.840
but I suspect he made some of it up.

00:37:51.599 --> 00:37:53.199
He said back when he was young,

00:37:53.519 --> 00:37:55.039
not long after he started the job,

00:37:56.000 --> 00:37:57.280
he was tailing a target.

00:37:57.280 --> 00:37:58.760
When the guy was finally going to meet his contact

00:37:58.920 --> 00:38:00.679
and they confirmed the location,

00:38:01.039 --> 00:38:02.199
the guy was so cautious

00:38:02.199 --> 00:38:04.360
he scoped out the place for three days straight.

00:38:05.280 --> 00:38:07.079
Yet on that exact day,

00:38:07.599 --> 00:38:08.679
he arrived only to find

00:38:09.159 --> 00:38:10.480
municipal roadwork underway.

00:38:10.800 --> 00:38:12.480
The whole street had been torn up,

00:38:12.679 --> 00:38:14.239
with over a hundred people working there.

00:38:15.679 --> 00:38:16.719
All that effort for nothing.

00:38:19.079 --> 00:38:20.400
If I were him,

00:38:20.559 --> 00:38:21.920
tailing one person for four years,

00:38:21.920 --> 00:38:23.320
bored out of my skull,

00:38:23.320 --> 00:38:25.079
I'd make up stories too.

00:38:27.119 --> 00:38:27.920
True enough.

00:38:29.159 --> 00:38:30.199
Can't fall asleep,

00:38:30.480 --> 00:38:31.800
and staying awake is pure torture.

00:38:32.079 --> 00:38:33.800
At least we can buy groceries and cook.

00:38:33.800 --> 00:38:35.079
That beats prison.

00:38:37.119 --> 00:38:39.199
Have you always had trouble sleeping?

00:38:40.360 --> 00:38:41.280
Can't handle stress.

00:38:41.280 --> 00:38:42.719
Whenever something's on my mind, I can't sleep.

00:38:42.920 --> 00:38:45.559
Does this kind of job hazard count as a work injury?

00:38:49.000 --> 00:38:51.480
Well, sweet dreams tonight, then.

00:38:52.400 --> 00:38:54.960
Dream that our "neighbor" gets caught soon,

00:38:55.119 --> 00:38:56.639
so we can go home early.

00:39:03.480 --> 00:39:04.239
Still, it seems like

00:39:04.239 --> 00:39:05.800
everyone has their own way.

00:39:06.000 --> 00:39:08.599
Sis Fengge told me last time a hot water bottle works,

00:39:09.079 --> 00:39:10.119
though I haven't tried it.

00:39:10.920 --> 00:39:11.880
Some people,

00:39:12.159 --> 00:39:14.239
maybe they're just natural sleepers.

00:39:14.239 --> 00:39:15.360
Old Wei once told me

00:39:15.519 --> 00:39:16.920
he falls asleep the second his head hits the pillow.

00:39:17.480 --> 00:39:18.519
Not even an earthquake could wake him.

00:39:18.519 --> 00:39:19.199
And yet,

00:39:19.360 --> 00:39:20.519
the second his phone rings, he's up.

00:39:20.519 --> 00:39:21.719
Never misses a beat.

00:39:24.280 --> 00:39:25.920
You're different from what I imagined.

00:39:26.119 --> 00:39:27.239
You talk quite a bit.

00:39:30.119 --> 00:39:31.880
What did your ex-girlfriends say about you?

00:39:33.960 --> 00:39:35.119
Which one?

00:39:36.320 --> 00:39:37.760
You've had that many?

00:39:39.199 --> 00:39:40.400
Looking at me,

00:39:40.400 --> 00:39:43.199
did you think I never even had a first love?

00:39:43.280 --> 00:39:44.000
Let me tell you,

00:39:44.239 --> 00:39:45.480
whether serious or not,

00:39:45.480 --> 00:39:47.039
there've definitely been six or seven.

00:39:47.719 --> 00:39:48.320
What about you?

00:39:48.960 --> 00:39:50.800
Then I'm really losing out compared to you.

00:39:50.960 --> 00:39:52.360
My family was too strict.

00:39:52.920 --> 00:39:54.719
I only dated once, with Huadong.

00:39:55.760 --> 00:39:56.960
And that wasn't even real.

00:39:59.440 --> 00:40:01.159
Though, you're pretty different from what I thought too.

00:40:01.800 --> 00:40:03.199
You're better behaved than I expected,

00:40:05.039 --> 00:40:05.920
more obedient.

00:40:09.199 --> 00:40:10.800
Tell me about one of your exes.

00:40:11.199 --> 00:40:12.000
Any of them.

00:40:17.320 --> 00:40:18.000
The one...

00:40:18.639 --> 00:40:19.960
that left the deepest impression

00:40:19.960 --> 00:40:21.239
was this one time.

00:40:21.639 --> 00:40:23.280
We planned to go bike riding,

00:40:24.480 --> 00:40:25.920
riding out to the city park.

00:40:26.880 --> 00:40:28.000
As we kept riding,

00:40:28.880 --> 00:40:29.920
it started pouring.

00:40:31.639 --> 00:40:34.199
I took her under a rockery to take shelter.

00:40:35.000 --> 00:40:37.280
Once the rain stopped, the bike was broken,

00:40:38.639 --> 00:40:40.119
so I had to walk her home.

00:40:40.679 --> 00:40:42.000
As we were walking,

00:40:42.480 --> 00:40:43.760
it started raining again.

00:40:45.360 --> 00:40:46.920
By the time she was home, it was past midnight.

00:40:50.400 --> 00:40:51.480
That's so romantic.

00:40:52.039 --> 00:40:53.079
Why did you break up?

00:40:54.440 --> 00:40:55.800
I never got around to asking her.

00:41:01.639 --> 00:41:03.199
Is love always this irrational?

00:41:03.800 --> 00:41:04.880
I'm gonna run out and buy something.

00:41:21.639 --> 00:41:24.000
Ah Zhong, here's what you asked for.

00:41:27.159 --> 00:41:28.840
So this is what a poppy looks like.

00:41:33.639 --> 00:41:34.320
Uncle,

00:41:36.280 --> 00:41:36.960
take this money.

00:41:37.559 --> 00:41:38.039
This... this is...

00:41:38.039 --> 00:41:38.960
Don't be polite. Take it.

00:41:39.119 --> 00:41:40.280
I'm always troubling you. Take it.

00:41:40.280 --> 00:41:40.920
It's too... too much.

00:41:40.920 --> 00:41:41.880
Just take it.

00:41:42.440 --> 00:41:43.760
Well, then I won't say no.

00:41:44.159 --> 00:41:45.440
One more thing, Uncle.

00:41:45.440 --> 00:41:47.320
Those foreign-funded factories nearby,

00:41:48.159 --> 00:41:49.199
whether from Taiwan, China,

00:41:49.639 --> 00:41:50.599
or from the US,

00:41:51.079 --> 00:41:52.239
keep an eye on them.

00:41:53.840 --> 00:41:54.559
And also,

00:41:55.519 --> 00:41:56.480
on the mountain nearby,

00:41:56.599 --> 00:41:58.119
isn't there a military signal tower?

00:41:58.119 --> 00:41:59.719
See if anyone tries to go up there.

00:41:59.719 --> 00:42:02.039
Also, if anyone comes asking about me,

00:42:02.159 --> 00:42:03.480
then they're definitely suspicious.

00:42:04.119 --> 00:42:05.440
Report it to me right away.

00:42:05.480 --> 00:42:06.840
Are you guys still catching spies?

00:42:08.840 --> 00:42:10.440
Just like rats in the field,

00:42:11.000 --> 00:42:11.800
you can never catch them all.

00:42:39.599 --> 00:42:42.119
Sis Fengge told me last time a hot water bottle works,

00:42:42.599 --> 00:42:43.559
though I haven't tried it.

00:42:44.559 --> 00:42:45.760
I'm gonna run out and buy something.

00:43:08.280 --> 00:43:09.280
I'm Peng Yuchang,

00:43:09.280 --> 00:43:10.880
inviting you to watch the drama series

00:43:10.880 --> 00:43:11.719
Confrontation.

00:43:11.800 --> 00:43:12.480
Find a way to get

00:43:12.480 --> 00:43:14.280
the memory card inside his computer.

00:43:14.280 --> 00:43:16.159
As long as the secrets inside are detailed enough,

00:43:16.159 --> 00:43:17.239
we can make the arrest.

00:43:19.400 --> 00:43:20.920
Brother Ma, what are you doing?

00:43:20.920 --> 00:43:21.880
Don't smash it on the floor!

00:43:21.880 --> 00:43:22.920
Smash it right here!

00:43:22.920 --> 00:43:23.920
Think you're the only one with a temper?

00:43:23.920 --> 00:43:24.880
I don't!

00:43:24.880 --> 00:43:25.920
What the hell?

00:43:25.920 --> 00:43:27.199
Watch the red light!

00:43:29.800 --> 00:43:31.199
You pick me up every day.

00:43:31.199 --> 00:43:32.800
Have you ever seen a fruit vendor at the intersection?

00:43:32.800 --> 00:43:33.519
No, never.

00:43:34.239 --> 00:43:35.519
Pull out right away. Leave now!